meta:
  origin:
    title: Estimated wild-caught finfish numbers
    title_snapshot: Estimated wild-caught finfish numbers – Global numbers by year
    description: |-
      Estimated numbers of individual finfishes caught annually from the wild for food, feed (often in the form of fishmeal and oil), and bait.
    producer: Fishcount
    citation_full: |-
      Fishcount.org.uk based on data from the Food and Agriculture Organization of the United Nations. Estimated wild-caught finfish numbers 2003 to 2022 by A Mood & P Brooke (2025), using the method described in Mood A, Brooke P. Estimating global numbers of fishes caught from the wild annually from 2000 to 2019. Animal Welfare. 2024;33:e6. doi:10.1017/awf.2024.7
    url_main: https://fishcount.org.uk/fish-count-estimates-2/numbers-of-fish-caught-from-the-wild-each-year
    url_download: https://fishcount.org.uk/estimates/wildfishes/data03/fishcount_global_wild_fish_estimate_by_year.php?2003to2022
    date_published: "2025"
    date_accessed: 2026-11-24
